# GitHub Personal Access Token (optional).
#
# Without a token, the GitHub API allows only 10 search requests per minute,
# which is fine for light personal use. To raise the limit to ~1800 requests
# per hour, create a classic token at:
#   https://github.com/settings/tokens
# No scopes are required for public data. Copy this file to ".env.local" and
# paste your token below. Never commit your real token.
#
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_your_token_here
